#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/os.md:1
msgid "OS 交付范围与验证"
msgstr "OS delivery scope and verification"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/os.md:3
msgid ""
"当前 OS 保持公共 Wait + 后端专属显式存储。平台不创建默认 worker、不启动 scheduler、 不隐式占用 task-notification "
"index，也不创建最大对象池。产品 composition 和恢复策略 位于独立 examples/product 工程。"
msgstr ""
"The OS retains public Wait plus backend-specific explicit storage. The platform creates no default"
" workers, starts no scheduler, implicitly occupies no task-notification index and creates no "
"maximum object pools. Product composition/recovery policy live in independent examples/product "
"projects."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/os.md:7
msgid ""
"当前机制的完整合同在 [OS contracts](../design/os-contracts.md)，逐项实际状态在 {download}`OS01–OS55 台账 "
"<../design/os-execution.csv>`。`implemented` 只表示代码存在，只有 与当前 clean "
"Git/配置/dependency/工具身份绑定的实际执行才建立软件资格。"
msgstr ""
"Full contracts are in [OS contracts](../design/os-contracts.md); per-item actual status is in "
"{download}`OS01–OS55 ledger <../design/os-execution.csv>`. `implemented` means code exists. "
"Software qualification requires actual execution bound to current clean Git/config/dependency/tool"
" identities."

