#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/os.md:26
msgid "外部应用交付"
msgstr "External application delivery"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/os.md:28
msgid ""
"`nexus-examples/apps/uart_owner_runtime` 使用生成 typed factory 的 UART face。Native 创建两个 producer 和一个 "
"owner 的真实 pthread；FreeRTOS 创建 producer/owner/stop coordinator 的显式静态任务；裸机用同一 owner 进行 cooperative "
"service。三板引用 已有 console route，不定义新的接线或 provider。"
msgstr ""
"`nexus-examples/apps/uart_owner_runtime` uses generated typed-factory UART faces. Native creates "
"actual pthreads for two producers/one owner. FreeRTOS creates explicit static producer/owner/stop-"
"coordinator tasks. Baremetal cooperatively services the same owner. Three Boards reuse existing "
"console routes without defining new wiring/providers."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/os.md:33
msgid ""
"关闭流程包含 stop admission、active cancel/drain、producer join、owner join、IRQ wake quiescence "
"和通知销毁。GoogleTest/GoogleMock 测试真实 BusOwner 和应用 shutdown 模块， mock 只替代外部 join/硬件 "
"quiescence；覆盖阶段顺序、超时、错误、提前回收和重试。"
msgstr ""
"Shutdown includes admission stop, active cancel/drain, producer join, owner join, IRQ-wake "
"quiescence and notification destruction. GoogleTest/GoogleMock exercise actual "
"BusOwner/application-shutdown modules, mocking only external join/hardware quiescence. Coverage "
"includes stage order, timeout, errors, premature reclaim and retries."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/os.md:37
msgid ""
"部分启动失败分别回收已取得的资源。Native 先关闭提交、保持 owner 排空并 join 已运行任务。FreeRTOS 启动前使用 "
"`nx_freertos_task_discard_before_scheduler`，先 suspend 移除内核候选 TCB 引用，再同步删除任务和完成 latch。它要求特权启动 "
"上下文、NOT_STARTED、wrapper 尚未执行且没有未配对的 scheduler suspension； 成功后才允许复用栈、TCB 和 context。运行中任务继续使用 "
"cooperative stop/join。 真实 POSIX kernel 回归验证逆序回收、回收存储毒化后复用、真实 scheduler 执行， 以及 scheduler 结束后拒绝 "
"discard 已执行 wrapper，不能替代 MCU 实板验证。"
msgstr ""
"Partial startup failures reclaim acquired resources separately. Native closes submission, keeps "
"the owner draining and joins running tasks. Pre-scheduler FreeRTOS uses "
"`nx_freertos_task_discard_before_scheduler`: suspend removes kernel candidate-TCB references "
"before synchronous task/completion-latch deletion. It requires privileged bootstrap, NOT_STARTED, "
"an unexecuted wrapper and no unmatched scheduler suspension. Successful discard alone permits "
"stack/TCB/context reuse; running tasks use cooperative stop/join. Actual POSIX-kernel regressions "
"verify reverse reclaim, poisoned-storage reuse, actual scheduler execution and refusal to discard "
"executed wrappers after scheduler end; they replace no MCU validation."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/os.md:45
msgid ""
"Native 的显式 host 栈为三个 64 KiB buffer；应用预算相应独立增加。这是 host thread fixture 的资源，不是 MCU 栈成本。MCU 采用各 256 "
"StackType_t word 的四任务参考预算， 声明 8-byte 对齐，仍需实板测量运行峰值，不能从启动最低容量推导。 FreeRTOS 示例停止 I/O 与发布者后保留 "
"scheduler 所需平台时钟/Tick，coordinator 挂起； Native/裸机可继续 platform stop。产品 reset/scheduler-stop 策略单独拥有。"
msgstr ""
"Native explicitly provides three 64 KiB host-stack buffers, separately increasing application "
"budgets; this is host-fixture cost, not MCU stacks. MCU references use four tasks of 256 "
"StackType_t words each with 8-byte alignment; physical peak measurement remains required and is "
"not inferred from startup minimums. After I/O/publisher stop, FreeRTOS retains scheduler "
"clock/Tick and suspends the coordinator. Native/baremetal may continue platform stop. Products "
"separately own reset/scheduler-stop policy."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/os.md:51
msgid "软件验证与实板边界"
msgstr "Software verification and physical boundaries"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/os.md:53
msgid ""
"软件执行应包含 deadline 持续 wake、最终完成竞争、端口启动栈拒绝、Baseline IRQ 完整绑定、close/drain、任务复用、direct notification "
"receiver/index、tickless 失败 和 trace overflow。GoogleMock 上下文模型、真实 POSIX kernel、Native 多任务示例、 九核 ABI "
"链接和安装 SDK 消费分别建立自己的证据。"
msgstr ""
"Software execution should cover continuously waking deadlines, final-completion races, startup-"
"stack rejection, complete Baseline IRQ binding, close/drain, task reuse, direct-notification "
"receiver/index, tickless failures and trace overflow. GoogleMock context models, actual POSIX "
"kernel, Native multitasking, nine-core ABI links and installed SDK consumption each establish "
"separate evidence."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/os.md:58
msgid ""
"可选 MPU 的十二个实际 ARM 软件变体和 V7/V8 host contract 已执行；当前拒绝 M0/M0+、 M7 kernel MPU 及 MPU+split。可选 split 的 "
"31 个 Secure/NS 配对（62 ELF）覆盖当前 M23/M33/M55/M85 CPU authority 组合，并核对七个真实 SG veneers、import、上下文 ASM 与"
" caller Idle callback，没有默认 Secure heap/pool。split 的两个 host lease targets 分别覆盖整数和共享 FP/MVE bank "
"软件合同。两类都需要消费者提供明确 linker、存储 和可信生命周期；软件 fixture 的地址是 synthetic，未执行实际 MPU fault、安全归属、 跨世界启动或真实 "
"context switch。细节见 [OS contracts](../design/os-contracts.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Twelve actual ARM MPU variants and V7/V8 host contracts were executed; M0/M0+, M7-kernel-MPU and "
"MPU+split are rejected. Optional split has 31 Secure/NS pairs (62 ELFs), covering maintained "
"M23/M33/M55/M85 CPU-authority combinations and checking seven real SG veneers/imports/context "
"ASM/caller Idle callbacks without default Secure heaps/pools. Two host lease targets cover "
"integer/shared-FP-MVE-bank software contracts. Both require explicit consumer "
"linkers/storage/trusted lifecycles. Fixture addresses are synthetic; actual MPU faults, security "
"attribution, cross-world startup/context switches remain unexecuted. See [OS "
"contracts](../design/os-contracts.md)."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/os.md:66
msgid ""
"OS49–55 的物理工装定义已经可执行为 prepare/validate 工具，但硬件尚未连接，未运行 实际 IRQ→task 延迟、FP/MVE register "
"retention、MSP/task peaks、Tick/deadline 误差、 满载生命周期、睡眠恢复或异常安全输出。准备计划保持 `prepared_unbound`，物理状态 保持 "
"`not_executed`。计划不是测量结果，更不是 WCET、安全认证或产品 release。"
msgstr ""
"OS49–55 physical fixtures execute as prepare/validate tools, but disconnected hardware means no "
"actual IRQ→task latency, FP/MVE retention, MSP/task peaks, Tick/deadline error, full-load "
"lifecycle, sleep recovery or exception-safe outputs. Plans remain `prepared_unbound`, physical "
"status `not_executed`. Plans are not measurements, WCET, safety certification or product releases."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/os.md:77
msgid ""
"实板接入后由 station owner 配置五项明确预算 `os_irq_latency`、`os_deadline_lateness`、 "
"`os_low_power_lateness`、`os_lifecycle`、`os_fail_response`；分别使用 us/us/us/count/us。 生命周期必须提供正 "
"minimum，其他四项使用 maximum。记录与 station admission 绑定， 不能在 acquisition context 内放宽预算。"
msgstr ""
"After hardware connection, station owners set five budgets: `os_irq_latency`, "
"`os_deadline_lateness`, `os_low_power_lateness`, `os_lifecycle`, `os_fail_response`, with "
"us/us/us/count/us units. Lifecycle requires positive minimum; the other four use maximum. Records "
"bind station admission and budgets cannot be relaxed inside acquisition context."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/os.md:82
msgid ""
"OS context 严格字段为 schema_version=1/kind=os_hil_context、admission_sha256、 workload/instrument file "
"identities、实际 load/executor/irq_priorities/cpu_clock_hz、 features.fpu/mve、完整 `stack_names` 和 "
"requirements。stack_names 列出 MSP 及该 workload 每个选定任务，raw stack trace 必须完全对应，不能只提交一个示例任务。features 与已 "
"admission 的 CPU ABI 完全一致。 每项独立 raw trace 绑定 context SHA，保留逐样本/寄存器/stack/lifecycle/fail-stop 数据， "
"不能传入一个自行填写 `status=passed` 的摘要替代。采集时间需 fresh UTC offset。"
msgstr ""
"Strict OS-context fields are schema_version=1/kind=os_hil_context, admission_sha256, "
"workload/instrument file identities, actual load/executor/irq_priorities/cpu_clock_hz, "
"features.fpu/mve, complete `stack_names` and requirements. Names include MSP/every selected "
"workload task and raw stack traces must match exactly, not one example task. Features exactly "
"match admitted CPU ABI. Each independent raw trace binds context SHA and retains per-"
"sample/register/stack/lifecycle/fail-stop data. A self-authored `status=passed` summary cannot "
"replace it. Acquisition time needs a fresh UTC offset."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/os.md:97
msgid ""
"报告要求未使用的输出目标，旧证据与输入永不覆盖。 这些命令只读取已保留记录，绝不自动操作硬件。测量方法、观测 load、供电、安全输出和 产品验收预算由实际 station/workload "
"审核，不能继承主机模型或旧提交的物理资格。"
msgstr ""
"Reports require unused output targets and never overwrite old evidence/inputs. These commands read"
" retained records only and never operate hardware automatically. Actual station/workload review "
"owns measurement method, observed load, power, safe outputs and product budgets; host models/old "
"commits confer no physical qualification."

