#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/os.md:119
msgid ""
"`maximum_waiters` 控制 close 的 scheduler-pause 遍历预算，payload item size 控制内核 单次复制的临界区预算。不可把整个 close "
"遍历的时间宣称为 IRQ 屏蔽时间，也不可用 静态 instruction 数代替测量延迟。成本门禁保留各自 argv、ELF/nm/disassembly 和尺寸； 资源最小 profile "
"与完整能力 profile 分别比较，禁止把不同负载的图像作为同一基线。"
msgstr ""
"`maximum_waiters` bounds close traversal while the scheduler is paused; payload item size bounds "
"each kernel-copy critical section. Entire close traversal is not IRQ-masked time and static "
"instruction counts are not measured latency. Cost gates retain argv, ELF/nm/disassembly/sizes. "
"Compare minimal-resource/complete-capability profiles separately; different-workload images are "
"not one baseline."
